{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/617558-missing-two-weapons-fighting-style","id":617558,"title":"missing two weapons fighting style?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-06T03:45:57-07:00","id":617558,"title":"missing two weapons fighting style?","content":"I will shortly be starting my very first Vampire B&amp;S campaign as an ST and looking forward to it. Now we are in the process of character creation and one of my players wishes to start with Ambidexterity and the Fighting Style Two Weapons. I have seen Ambidexterity as a merrit but am unable to find the two weapon fighting style in the updated books, I am missing it somewhere has it been reworked / removed? Can is use the 'old' fighting style as is without creating any balance issues?<br /> <br /> appreciate any feedback.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7177-kurt","name":"Kurt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7177_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T03:58:17-07:00","id":617604,"title":"","content":"This should probably be in the general WoD forum and not vamp, but anyways. No, there currently is not a Two Weapon fighting style. Which, to be honest, is probably a good thing, given how common Arm Wrecks are in this new edition as opposed to the old one. You could, in theory, use the old one as long as you eliminated the two attacks on one person - the only way to get two attacks under the new system is through different targets. You can never attack the same person twice in one turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T04:00:23-07:00","id":617606,"title":"","content":"The first two dots are covered by the Armed Defense style. The third and fourth were executed due to policy changes regarding multiple attacks, as described above.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T04:05:24-07:00","id":617609,"title":"","content":"Noted on the incorrect subforum, and obviously something went wrong during posting as well, it was not my intention to ask the same question 5 times in a row, but I kept getting a syntax error when I tried to post so it seemed the thread wasn't started, hopefully one of the moderators can clean that up.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the speedy responses though, if I have more questions in the future (which I probably will) I'll be sure to post them here or in the general WoD forum, as applicable, and I'll do my best to only create 1 thread per question.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7177-kurt","name":"Kurt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7177_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"ke